<p>Decimal 36878. Raw name for this VIC chip register. Also known as <strong>AUX_COLOR_AND_VOLUME</strong>, where the full description lives.</p>
<p>Sound volume and auxiliary colour.</p>
<ul>
<li>Bits 7-4 - auxiliary colour, the fourth colour of multicolour characters (0-15)</li>
<li>Bits 3-0 - master sound volume, 0 is silent and 15 is loudest</li>
</ul>
